  "notes": "Production LED behavior: only the four LEDs in the third section second panel turn white; the first four stay off. Modes, brightness, and charging state persist. Adds automatic IR ambient handling and an approximately 1 m uncalibrated IR proxy, a smoothly animated custom icon, and sleep/shutdown fade. Startup bus readiness and sensor retries are bounded; sensor and NTC alerts remain individual. DEV mode has no fullscreen critical alert while protections remain active. Hardware acceptance remains pending and charger diagnostics remain unresolved and paused; no charger diagnostic was resumed and no hardware-success claim is made.",
